sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant NG as Nginx
    participant FA as FastAPI
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant RD as Redis

    Note over B,RD: Registration Flow
    B->>NG: POST /api/auth/register {username, password, role}
    NG->>FA: Proxy request
    FA->>FA: Validate input, hash password (bcrypt)
    FA->>DB: INSERT user record
    DB-->>FA: User ID
    FA-->>NG: 201 Created {user_id, username, role}
    NG-->>B: Registration success

    Note over B,RD: Login Flow
    B->>NG: POST /api/auth/login {username, password}
    NG->>FA: Proxy request
    FA->>DB: SELECT user by username
    DB-->>FA: User record (hashed pw, role)
    FA->>FA: bcrypt.verify(password, hash)
    alt Invalid credentials
        FA-->>B: 401 Unauthorized
    else Valid
        FA->>FA: generate_jwt(user_id, role, exp=8h)
        FA->>RD: SET session:{user_id} role TTL=8h
        FA-->>NG: 200 OK {access_token, token_type}
        NG-->>B: JWT access token
    end

    Note over B,RD: Protected Request Flow
    B->>NG: GET /api/sessions/active (Bearer JWT)
    NG->>FA: Proxy with Authorization header
    FA->>FA: decode_jwt() -> user_id, role, exp
    alt Token expired
        FA-->>B: 401 Token expired
    else Token valid
        FA->>DB: SELECT active sessions for user_id
        DB-->>FA: Session list
        FA-->>NG: 200 OK {sessions}
        NG-->>B: Protected resource
    end
